 "section_summary": "This section contains educational records and official correspondence relating to the post-World War II Japanese school system compiled under SCAP. It includes the concluding statistical tables and roster pages for elementary, secondary, private, and specialized educational institutions in Ibaraki Prefecture, accompanied by a regional reference map of Kanto. It also contains U.S. Foreign Service Despatch No. 646 from Tokyo (October 1, 1948) transmitting further prefecture reports, followed by the introductory text, classification charts, and initial summary statistics for Part 20 covering Kochi Prefecture.",
