   "summary": "This opening section of Part 20 of the SCAP educational report covers Kochi Prefecture, detailing the organizational structure, methodology, and comprehensive school statistics as of April and November 1946. It includes an extensive introduction explaining Japanese educational governance, jurisdiction definitions, and data collection procedures, alongside a classification chart of educational institutions. Summary tables provide prefecture-wide numerical and percentage distributions of schools, students, and teachers across higher, secondary, elementary, and special education levels by control jurisdiction. The section concludes with the first detailed breakdown table for institutions operating directly under the Ministry of Education.",
